    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Todwarae ŋuna ka arikoro Babilon",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alokaru a ŋolo a ŋiomwon ipukat erwosit Yeoiakim lokoku a Yosia a ŋolo a Yudaya (Torae ŋol ekaru ŋolo esyaunan ipukat erwosit Nebukadinesar ŋolo a Babilob) kirwor Ekapolon neni a Yeremia aŋuna a ŋituŋa a Yudaya a daadaŋ, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abu Yeremia ekadwaran tolimok ŋakiro ŋun ŋituŋa a Yudaya daadaŋ ka ŋituŋa daadaŋ ŋulu eboiyete alo Yerusalem. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŋakiro ŋun ikes nu: Ameun alokaru a ŋolo a ŋitomon ka ŋiuni ipukat Yosia lokoku ka Amon a ŋolo a Yudaya tari nakoloŋit na, erae tokona ŋikaru ŋatomoniarei ka ŋiuni, erwor Ekapolon ŋakiro keŋ neni kaŋ ka adau ayoŋ akirwor ŋakiro ŋun neni kus ŋinapaki daadaŋ, nai nyiirara iyes. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tari ŋina arubakinitor Ekapolon ikiyakiyanakini iyes ŋiketiyak keŋ ŋikadwarak nyiirara iyes, kori nyepupokina daŋ, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "apaki ŋina ikilimokiniata ŋikadwarak iyes ebe, “Kilocokisi ŋipitesyo kus ŋulu aronok tokona, iyes ŋituŋa daadaŋ, kimyekisi akitiya ŋuna aronok, ido ipote iyes akiboi jik anakwap a ŋina abu Ekapolon ikiinak iyes ka neni atapapaa kus ŋinapei koloŋ sek tari ŋikaru ka ŋikaru, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyiwuapa ŋakujo ŋace anakitiyanakin ka anakilipenen neni kec ka nyikitoŋoa ayoŋ a ŋiboro a ŋulu itiyaununeete iyes a ŋakan kus, kitiyata iyes ŋun nyetiyakini ayoŋ aronis adio neni kus.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nai nyiwuapa iyes ŋakiro kaŋ, aŋun ikitoŋoa iyes ayoŋ a ŋiboro kaŋ, aŋun ikitoŋoa iyes ayoŋ a ŋiboro a ŋulu itiyaununeete iyes a ŋakan kus, ŋakiro ŋun ikiinakis iyes ŋican.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋun, alimu Ekapolon ŋolo a ŋajoresyo ebe, “Aŋuna pa aponere iyes kiwuapae ŋakiro kaŋ, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anyarauni ayoŋ ŋituŋa a ŋikabilae a ŋulu a lo Kuju ka a eketiyan kaŋ Nebukadinesar ŋolo a Babilon, ayauni ayoŋ ikes kitijioto akwap na anyarauni ayoŋ ikes kitijioto ŋituŋa a Yudaya ka ŋituŋa a ŋakwapin a daadaŋ a ŋuna idunyatar ikes. Amunyari ayoŋ ikes jik, eturuwo ikes ŋulu ebulit ka ŋulu irumito ŋileec ta ŋulu inyasuna ŋikaru ka ŋikaru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alemari ayoŋ aneni kec ecelet ŋolo ka alelyanu ka ecelet ŋolo ka alakara, alemari ayoŋ ecelet ŋolo a eteran ka ŋolo a ateran, ecelet ŋolo ka amoru a ŋinakiryeet ka akica ŋina a etaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inyasunio akwap na daadaŋ ka eruwor acaryoit, ido epote ŋituŋa a ŋakwapin a ŋun akitiyanakin erwosit a Babilon ŋikaru ŋatomonikanikaarei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekaku a ŋikaru a ŋatomonikanikaarei esicani ayoŋ erwosit a Babilon ka ŋituŋa a akwap a ŋin, akwap a Ŋibabiloniyae, aŋuna ka asecit kec, eruwor akwap ŋin acaryoit ŋikaru ka ŋikaru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Esiyookini ayoŋ aŋuna ka akwap a ŋin ŋakiro daadaŋ ŋuna abu ayoŋ olimu emanit iŋes, iyookin ŋakiro daadaŋ ŋuna a ŋiman ŋuna abu Yeremia todwar ŋuna igiritae lokitaabo lo, ŋakiro ŋuna a ŋituŋa a ŋakwapin a daadaŋ, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "anerae epote ŋituŋa a ŋakwapin a ŋuna alalak ka ŋirwosi ŋulu agogoŋok akituruwor ikes ŋipi, ido esicani ayoŋ ŋituŋa ka ŋirwosi ŋul aŋuna a ŋiticisyo kec ka aŋuna a ŋiboro a ŋulu itiyaununeete ikes a ŋakan kec.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ŋican ŋulu epote aŋuna ka anyunyura ka Akuj",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu Ekapolon Akuj a Ŋisirael okolimok ayoŋ tema, “Tolema anakan kaŋ ekopo lo ŋolo ileleba epiini ŋolo ka anyunyura kaŋ, inak ŋituŋa a ŋakwapin a daadaŋ a ŋuna ekeyakiyari ayoŋ iyoŋ neni kec tomata epiini ŋol. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emasete ikes epiini ŋol, ido kiteritereonor ka tobaŋaaniyasi aŋuna a ejie a ŋolo eyakikini ayoŋ ikes.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aŋun, abu ayoŋ ejau ekopo anakan a Ekapolon, oinak ŋituŋa daadaŋ a ŋakwapin a ŋuna abu Ekapolon ekeyakiya ayoŋ neni kec, apotu ikes tomata epiini ŋolo ayai lokopo ŋol. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŋituŋa ŋulu apotu tomata epiini ikes lu: Ŋituŋa a Yerusalem ka ŋituŋa a ŋitaunio a Yudaya, ŋirwosi keŋ ka ŋikapolok. Apotu ŋitaunio ŋul toruworos ŋireŋoroto, ŋicaryo ŋulu ejamuwanaryo ka ŋulu icenio, lopite ŋolo eyakatar nakoloŋit na. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eryamunete ŋituŋa lu daŋ ŋican ŋul: Parao erwosit a Ijipit, ŋiketiyak keŋ, ŋikapolok ŋulu ipukatotor iŋes ka ŋituŋa keŋ daadaŋ, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ŋituŋa ŋulu inyalal daadaŋ, ŋirwosi daadaŋ ŋulu ka akwap a Us, ŋirwosi daadaŋ ŋulu ka akwap a Ŋipilistin, ikes Askelon, Gasa, Ekiron, ŋipiya ŋulu ka Acidod; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "eryamunete ŋituŋa ŋulu eya Edom, Moab ka Ŋiamoni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ŋirwosi daadaŋ ŋulu a Tiro, ŋirwosi daadaŋ ŋulu a Sidon ka ŋirwosi a ŋakwapin a daadaŋ a ŋuna alokekwaye anam a ŋuna idunyito anam; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "eryamunete ŋituŋa ŋulu eya Dedan, Tema, Bus ka ŋituŋa daadaŋ ŋulu ikebito ŋipeneka kec, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ŋirwosi daadaŋ ŋulu ka Arabia ka ŋirwosi daadaŋ ŋulu a ŋituŋa a ŋulu inyalal a ŋulu iboiyete analoŋisat; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ŋirwosi daadaŋ ŋulu a Simiri, ŋirwosi daadaŋ ŋulu ke Elam ka ŋirwosi daadaŋ ŋulu a Media, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ŋirwosi daadaŋ ŋulu a ŋakwapin a ŋuna alo Kuju, a ŋuna eapiyete ka a ŋuna alwanak eryamunete ŋulutuŋa ŋun ekaku a ŋuluce; eryamunete ŋapukasinei daadaŋ ŋuna ka akwap a daadaŋ ŋican ŋul. Ekaku kec daadaŋ, toryamu nai erwosit a Sesak.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
