        },
        {
          "text": "“Ilimokini nai iyoŋ ikes ebe, ‘Alimu Ekapolon ŋolo a ŋajoresyo, Akuj a Ŋisirael atemar tomata, tomerakinos, toleka, ido kibusokinos nyinyout nabo aŋuna a ejie a ŋolo eyakuunit ayoŋ neni kus.’",
          "type": "text",
