        },
        {
          "text": "“Ani kewout ikes akijaar ekopo anakan kon ikotere tomata, ilimokini nai iyoŋ ikes ebe, ‘Alimu Ekapolon ŋolo a ŋajoresyo atemar emaikina iyes tomata! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
